{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Normalize sampling into the documented half-open interval**\n\nDividing by `0xffffffff` maps the maximum unsigned hash to exactly `1.0`, contradicting the documented `[0,1)` range and shifting the deterministic boundary. Coordinate fixed-vector behavior across SDKs, divide by `2^32` (`0x1_0000_0000L`), and add boundary tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sNymu","finding_digest":"e7d59d7f97adf9275b8c6059f365d1f81f01b4bd532c18412ba85b880824af36","finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","line":478,"observation_digest":"261986db8673ced659852963f9f3cfc971b042c1d392d96564af28b4e32e86ea","observation_id":"aro_v1_eymynw4gophnmwmfffr7t46pzf","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","published_at":"2026-09-08T23:03:42Z","review_id":"arr_v1_iee7bcnfj7lcytdfodx5mvljjs","reviewed_base_sha":"730f534832656d1da8a3205f5468595ffb05f33d","reviewed_head_sha":"ce1de5fa37a2da2f6805802585eeee8390944531","reviewer":"codex","start_line":478,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_hg46o7w63pj6v7nbrjik64xb3x","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T23:03:42Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
